"Warning: only {free} GiB free for the Nix store ({need} GiB recommended)."
msgstr "警告：Nix store 仅剩 {free} GiB 可用空间（建议 {need} GiB）。"

#: src/roudix_installer/pages/progress.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Warning: your configuration uses system.stateVersion {old}, Roudix sets "
"{new}. Services that keep data (databases…) deserve a look before booting it."
msgstr ""
"警告：你的配置使用 system.stateVersion {old}，而 Roudix 设置为 {new}。保存数"
"据的服务（数据库等）在启动前值得检查一下。"

#: src/roudix_installer/pages/progress.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Note: Roudix will use the {new} bootloader (yours: {old}). If it ever fails "
"to start, RESTORE.txt in the backup explains how to put your old "
"configuration back."
msgstr ""
"注意：Roudix 将使用 {new} 引导程序（你当前的是 {old}）。如果无法启动，备份中"
"的 RESTORE.txt 说明了如何恢复旧配置。"

#: src/roudix_installer/pages/progress.py
msgid ""
"Reusing /etc/nixos/hardware-configuration.nix (the one that boots this "
"machine)."
msgstr ""
"重用 /etc/nixos/hardware-configuration.nix（即让这台机器能够启动的那个文"
"件）。"

